Data.DatabaseSchemes:
```sql
CREATE TABLE Users (
    UserId UUID PRIMARY KEY,
    Email VARCHAR(255) UNIQUE NOT NULL,
    RegistrationDate TIMESTAMP DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP
);

CREATE TABLE PageViews (
    PageViewId UUID PRIMARY KEY,
    UserId UUID REFERENCES Users(UserId),
    PagePath VARCHAR(500) NOT NULL,
    ViewTimestamp TIMESTAMP DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP
);

CREATE TABLE ContentItems (
    ItemId UUID PRIMARY KEY,
    Title VARCHAR(255) NOT NULL,
    Body TEXT,
    LastUpdated TIMESTAMP DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP
);
```
Storage Technology Summary: Relational database (e.g., PostgreSQL, MySQL) for structured user and content data, with a distributed cache (e.g., Redis) for session management and frequently accessed static content.
